--- stage: type
[
  # Unwrap extracts the first member of a Union TypeNode.
  Unwrap: [fn [let typenode]
    [match typenode
      [case [let p] [TypeNode.Union p] [builtin-dict-nth p.types 0]]
      ...: typenode]]
]
---
# Assigning String literal to @Integer annotation should produce type warning.
# @[Unwrap [or String Integer]] resolves to TypeNode.String → type String.
# The value "hello" satisfies String but not Integer.
[
  x@[Unwrap [or String Integer]]: "hello"
  y@Integer: x
]
=== out
Dict({"x": String("hello"), "y": String("hello")})

=== warn
cannot unify Integer with String
